@wx.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7278

### Get token
# @name login
POST {{wx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "string",
  "password": "string"
}


###
GET {{wx.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


